$ /help
Available commands:

Modes:
  /mode            Set or cycle the agent mode (manual/auto/plan/chat)
  /modes           List agent modes, marking the active one

Core:
  /help            Show available commands
  /clear           Clear the session history
  /compact         Compact session to reduce token usage
  /init            Initialize project with standard files
  /current-model   Show the current model

Session:
  /status          Show session status
  /session         Manage sessions

Model:
  /model           Cycle to the next model; /model <name> picks one, /current-model shows it

Output:
  /cost            Show token usage and cost
  /export          Export conversation to file

Tools:
  /plan            Toggle plan mode (outline before executing)
  /memory          Show system prompt and context state

Other:
  /cleanup         List saved sessions by size/age; delete with --confirm
  /diagnose        Report provider, permissions, and storage state
  /effort          Show or cycle reasoning effort (usage: /effort [low|medium|high])
  /limit           Show or set the session tool-call limit
  /theme           Cycle to the next theme, or set one by name


$ /help modes
/modes - List agent modes, marking the active one

$ /help no-such-command
Unknown command: /no-such-command

$ /no-such-command
Unknown command: /no-such-command
Type /help for available commands

